A. \sqrt{6}
B. 2\sqrt{2}
C. 2\sqrt{3}
D. \sqrt{14}
Answer with only A, B, C, or D.

The infinite series 1 + \frac{1}{3} + \frac{1}{3^{2}} + \frac{1}{3^{3}} + \cdots What is the sum of the series up to infinity?
A. \frac{3}{2}
B. \frac{4}{3}
C. \frac{3}{4}
D. \frac{2}{3}
Answer with only A, B, C, or D.

If x = 2 + \sqrt{3}, then \frac{1}{x} = ?
A. 1
B. \frac{1}{2 - \sqrt{3}}
C. 2 - \sqrt{3}
D. 7 - 4\sqrt{3}
Answer with only A, B, C, or D.

sin10\degree = p হলে sin20\degree এর মান কোনটি?
A. 2p
B. 2p\sqrt{1 - p^{2}}
C. 2p\sqrt{p^{2} - 1}
D. 2\sqrt{1 - p^{2}}
Answer with only A, B, C, or D.

If sin^{3}\theta + sin\theta cos^{2}\theta = - 1 then which one of the following is correct?
A. \theta = n\pi
B. \theta = (2n + 1)\pi
C. \theta = (4n - 1) \frac{\pi}{2}
D. \theta = (4n + 1) \frac{\pi}{2}
